# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/
/export/
# export_presets.cfg is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# Godot's shipped template ignores it because it can carry signing credentials
# and store passwords. This project's carries none -- one Web preset with
# thread_support off -- and ignoring it made the build unreproducible: a fresh
# clone and any CI runner had no preset and could not export at all.
#
# If a preset ever gains a keystore path or a password, ignore it again and
# move the secret out; do not leave both in one file.
# export_presets.cfg
